  "helpSerendipityMorningTitle": "Morning rehearsal",
  "helpSerendipityMorningBody": "Every morning, spend two minutes locking in today's luck expectation. Write down the good thing you want to happen, run the countdown to stay focused, then use positive psychology to reinforce that belief.",
